resources_capacities.csv includes total available amount of each resource in the horizon (real)

Thought: I need to retrieve all product data (profit per unit, resource consumption per unit, upper demand per product) from factory_products_100.csv, and the total available amount of each resource from resources_capacities.csv. I will preserve all identifiers and coefficients as given.

